// The boss walking (docs/architecture.md section 11, "模型和动画"): 48
// ticks, looping, written for WALK_CLIP_SPEED = 2.5 m/s: two steps of 1 m
// a cycle. Each foot is down 55% of the cycle, from 0.55 m ahead of the
// hips to 0.55 m behind, keyed every 2 ticks so that it keeps still on the
// ground (the left foot sets down at 0, the right at 24); it lifts up to
// 16 cm swinging forward. The hips sink 16.5 cm, 2 cm more with the feet
// apart; the body leans forward. The left arm swings against the legs; the
// right holds the halberd upright, swinging a little.
